msgstr "6.1 Modes"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:286 7dba90c63b9f4051aa90604cae6d0f3a
msgid "`tag`：按 `structure.tag` 正则匹配。"
msgstr "`tag`: regular-expression match against `structure.tag`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:287 edfe6af4526941ebabf8580b9a2fd590
msgid "`formula`：按 `structure.formula` 正则匹配。"
msgstr "`formula`: regular-expression match against `structure.formula`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:288 f5e1966b25d1407893d3f946563b7217
msgid "`elements`：元素集合语法匹配（非正则）。"
msgstr "`elements`: element-set syntax, not a regular expression."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:289 258b9bd1a0274e15acec67c19ce12a52
msgid "`expression`：按结构级表达式筛选；适合按原子数、元素组成、能量、力、应力、原子属性等条件批量选中。"
msgstr ""
"`expression`: structure-level Boolean filtering over atom counts, "
"composition, energy, force, stress, atomic properties, and other available "
"fields."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:291 ed62a06a5dd84178b178496f803bea0d
msgid "6.2 `elements` 语法"
msgstr "6.2 `elements` syntax"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:293 ec78e052f53946e085b754c3890921ba
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Fe,O`：元素集合必须是 `{Fe,O}` 子集。"
msgstr "`Fe,O`: the structure's element set must be a subset of `{Fe,O}`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:294 fa32a1556fa14bf3a9644467a21224b6
msgid "`+Fe,+O`：必须同时包含 `Fe` 和 `O`。"
msgstr "`+Fe,+O`: both `Fe` and `O` must be present."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:295 a629877e3211427a884bdd0fd9fbe014
msgid "`-H` 或 `!H`：必须不包含 `H`。"
msgstr "`-H` or `!H`: `H` must be absent."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:296 13171f6ec0f045d0affae5d01f588b4d
msgid "可混合：`Fe,O,+Fe,-H`。"
msgstr "Forms can be combined, for example `Fe,O,+Fe,-H`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:299 fe24fbbef0644cd79cd0682afd2fe793
msgid "6.3 `expression` 用法总览"
msgstr "6.3 `expression` overview"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:301 8f69eddeac684a5fb1048e22010cd329
msgid "目的：把“结构是否满足条件”写成一个布尔表达式，然后用搜索/勾选/反选按钮处理结果。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: express whether each structure satisfies a condition, then use "
"Search, Select, or Deselect on the matches."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:302 273406d2ee4647b3b73d50b0a7518f6e
msgid "作用对象：仅当前 active structures；已经删除的结构不会参与表达式计算。"
msgstr "Scope: current active structures only. Deleted structures are not evaluated."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:303 226d35dc3ed54be88ab5484bce5d12e4
msgid "搜索按钮：高亮匹配结构。"
msgstr "Search: highlight matching structures."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:304 3869c91a47ff4d448ff39576ed540d07
msgid "勾选按钮：把匹配结构加入当前选择集。"
msgstr "Select: add matches to the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:305 dedf39a4342b472fba60df3296d3ff15
msgid "反选按钮：把匹配结构从当前选择集中移除。"
msgstr "Deselect: remove matches from the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:306 51d543d8fbf44596b6b27e2a36eff95d
msgid "删除流程不变：通常是先用 expression 勾选，再点工具栏删除按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Deletion remains explicit: normally select with an expression, inspect the "
"result, and then click the toolbar delete button."

