"Although internal parsing handles prefix case, always use standard element-"
"symbol capitalization in documentation and input."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:372 939633a4772f4d2aa1a55b94ccbe12bd
msgid "如果当前 active structures 中没有该元素，表达式会报错"
msgstr ""
"If the element is absent from all active structures, the expression reports "
"an error."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:374 68bb5bfbfba74dd8936eb9e1b198f048
msgid "6.3.5 动态数据字段"
msgstr "6.3.5 Dynamic data fields"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:376 64939f403af24f8bafd7f9629cbbfa42
msgid "当前结果数据里存在什么字段，expression 模式就暴露什么字段。常见来源有两类："
msgstr ""
"Expression mode exposes only fields that exist in the current result data. "
"They commonly come from two sources:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:378 abfa1c773a8a4956a3e264d997bddb2d
msgid "结果数据集字段：如 `force`、`mforce`、`stress`、`virial`、`dipole`、`bec`"
msgstr ""
"Result-dataset fields such as `force`, `mforce`, `stress`, `virial`, "
"`dipole`, and `bec`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:379 fc7a5df08e4543ff8813479894e5a34e
msgid "原子属性字段：写成 `atomic.<name>`，例如 `atomic.spin_vec`"
msgstr ""
"Atomic-property fields written as `atomic.<name>`, for example "
"`atomic.spin_vec`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:381 a98bbfd5c6574c33b41a7c648677695f
msgid "这意味着："
msgstr "Consequences:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:383 13042856f2964c6d8f631c29e7ff9ec9
msgid "如果当前数据里没有 `mforce`，补全中不会出现 `mforce`"
msgstr ""
"If the current data contain no `mforce`, autocomplete does not offer "
"`mforce`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:384 adbba534b572470e99c714d6de690272
msgid "如果手动输入了不存在的字段，例如 `mforce.ref.x > 1`，会直接报错"
msgstr ""
"Manually entering an unavailable field, such as `mforce.ref.x > 1`, produces"
" an error."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:386 a77dfc5e8d6244999f53b8db3f76dab7
msgid "6.3.6 后缀规则"
msgstr "6.3.6 Suffix rules"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:388 4163f9b8610c47019260619bc61f87f1
msgid "A. 数据视图后缀"
msgstr "A. Data-view suffixes"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:390 d609a8ef7ca745db80dfd81d37e12350
msgid "对于有参考值/预测值成对存在的数据集字段，可以追加："
msgstr ""
"For dataset fields that provide paired reference and prediction values, "
"append:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:392 34739fc6a2b24bcea78537de2445b3c3
msgid "`.ref`：参考值"
msgstr "`.ref`: reference value"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:393 7c82543690ab4792b92ee3bedd386fca
msgid "`.pred`：预测值"
msgstr "`.pred`: predicted value"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:394 4a1d639c1b464f70aeab9ee3f794eb91
msgid "`.err`：误差，等价于 `pred - ref`"
msgstr "`.err`: error, defined as `pred - ref`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:396 ed4f6ec9d24a4ae696a146367868a53a
msgid "如果省略视图后缀，默认使用 `.ref`。"
msgstr "When the data-view suffix is omitted, `.ref` is used by default."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:400 3814ccc6c4184efc90e6bbe211b4d23b
msgid "`force.x > 10` 等价于 `force.ref.x > 10`"
msgstr "`force.x > 10` is equivalent to `force.ref.x > 10`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:401 63d2112d76ff4cc3926a903745fa2d17
msgid "`stress.err.norm > 2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:402 0603dda89971452291332397ab80148c
msgid "`energy.pred > -4.0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:404 a6db68ce0a8e4d31a4995f05bbe4836d
msgid "并不是所有字段都支持这三个后缀："
msgstr "Not every field supports all three suffixes:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:406 813e2922eb844f54bb7805f0dbb60a7f
msgid "`atomic.<name>` 不支持 `.ref/.pred/.err`"
msgstr "`atomic.<name>` does not support `.ref`, `.pred`, or `.err`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:407 d7c9d3ee8e5943a09a6fca1510336134
msgid "非成对数据字段也不支持 `.pred/.err`"
msgstr "Unpaired data fields do not support `.pred` or `.err`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:409 5d0019b51aa348c28d89219539274e7c
msgid "B. 分量与范数后缀"
msgstr "B. Component and norm suffixes"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:411 b068537455f349a4b2ee43df4f2bacbc
msgid "向量或张量字段支持命名分量后缀，例如："
msgstr "Vector and tensor fields support named component suffixes:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:413 fd8c1325c93647b895690fc86ffe4cad
msgid "三维向量：`.x`、`.y`、`.z`"
msgstr "Three-component vectors: `.x`, `.y`, `.z`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:414 37f7cf24e30e42469fb701fe1f268f4e
msgid "六分量张量：`.xx`、`.yy`、`.zz`、`.xy`、`.yz`、`.zx`"
msgstr "Six-component tensors: `.xx`, `.yy`, `.zz`, `.xy`, `.yz`, `.zx`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:415 657a8783c9654b5984bc7cdb599c6645
msgid "范数：`.norm`"
msgstr "Norm: `.norm`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:419
#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:473 7b7b1a235ab944e38f160c5ff687daef
#: a7d49e08328c4dd88bca4c1c1b983204
msgid "`force.x > 10`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:420 fb2c4a45a0fe4a0a8cba036cb00fd13f
msgid "`mforce.norm > 5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:421 67ac4c3879a44aca8933f7d9cd8a94cb
msgid "`virial.xx < -20`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:422 8e691375d41647a7b30d5dd9328a182e
msgid "`atomic.spin_vec.z > 0.2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:424 6d6515f3c7ef4ca0ba7820fdec5d3354
msgid "注意："
msgstr "Important:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:426 97b5fa011c3140d2aecb1ad288fc312c
msgid "不支持 `.1/.2/.3` 这类数字分量写法"
msgstr "Numeric components such as `.1`, `.2`, and `.3` are unsupported."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:427 ac9ad50e74b64fb18e6e9912a2248384
msgid "多分量字段若不写分量或 `.norm`，表达式会报错"
msgstr ""
"A multicomponent field without a named component or `.norm` produces an "
"error."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:428 23356585442a421c87904018b67d04ab
msgid "标量字段可以直接比较，例如 `energy > -10`"
msgstr "Scalar fields can be compared directly, for example `energy > -10`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:430 16da6b89665f4ef790261606a064ec83
msgid "6.3.7 原子级字段如何聚合到结构级"
msgstr "6.3.7 Aggregating atomic fields to structures"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:432 15b61ff43c0247dba13927a3273f6f4a
msgid "表达式最终必须得到“每个结构是否命中”的结果，所以原子级数据会先聚合到结构级。"
msgstr ""
"An expression must return one Boolean result per structure, so atom-level "
"data are reduced to a structure-level value first."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:434 f9ab29b526284986a635a6b1cc24f316
msgid "默认规则："
msgstr "Default rule:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:436 4ade2cfe330347e899a24c4928759434
msgid "先按你写的后缀取出分量或范数"
msgstr "First extract the named component or norm."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:437 fe4387cea11c47588720034711d9ec85
msgid "再在该结构内部做 `max(abs(values))`"
msgstr "Then calculate `max(abs(values))` within each structure."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:439 68815dc77d514e24bdb7d11dea907414
msgid "因此："
msgstr "Therefore:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:441 b37efe6592e842329da14502652d19c6
msgid "`force.x > 10` 的含义是“这个结构里是否存在原子满足 `max(abs(force_x)) > 10`”"
msgstr "`force.x > 10` asks whether `max(abs(force_x)) > 10` within each structure."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:442 889ee7f94f6d4a97aa2388b11eac775e
msgid "`force.norm > 10` 的含义是“这个结构里是否存在原子满足 `max(force_norm) > 10`”"
msgstr "`force.norm > 10` asks whether `max(force_norm) > 10` within each structure."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:443 0460f77e64c540988dc51bdade128f46
msgid "`atomic.spin_vec.y > 0.5` 的含义也是同样的结构级最大绝对值判断"
msgstr ""
"`atomic.spin_vec.y > 0.5` uses the same structure-level maximum-absolute-"
"value reduction."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:445 1a1ae0a9df70418d8fa2170da1bd254d
msgid "结构级字段如 `natoms`、`volume`、`energy` 不需要额外聚合，直接逐结构比较。"
msgstr ""
"Structure-level fields such as `natoms`, `volume`, and `energy` are compared"
" directly without aggregation."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:447 a1cc0aa89dd1498dbb48f7a0c026a022
msgid "6.3.8 常用表达式示例"
msgstr "6.3.8 Common expression examples"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:449 609d7ade09ba4ee89b1e092678d1a653
msgid "按结构大小筛选"
msgstr "Filter by structure size"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:452 9418210d7662488cb24bd5cc76037e31
msgid "`natoms >= 32 && natoms <= 128`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:454 85cfa642fa404cf99d02256941cdf0e9
msgid "按晶格或体积筛选"
msgstr "Filter by lattice or volume"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:456 e9fb50349d7e4b04b7768fe7e548d7cb
msgid "`volume < 1000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:457 9cf346ea98bd4c8db8dbeb71a6118843
msgid "`a > 3 && b > 3 && c > 3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:458 1a876f314b0a4e6ca14fa0cf1a452973
msgid "`gamma != 120`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:460 0a9d78c7c0f34f91acc1139ae7e64c89
msgid "按元素组成筛选"
msgstr "Filter by composition"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:462 e71a19a121874d10b2871fd037cf13d2
msgid "`count.O >= 4`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:463 834670b397634040a6f9ef84fa904b8d
msgid "`frac.Li > 0.25`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:464 5852b208be324070b00b3d0e6d7d13ca
msgid "`has.Fe && !has.H`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:466 94b04faaf0254138a6458725d7f24f43
msgid "按能量筛选"
msgstr "Filter by energy"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:468 04e6836ad74f49fa8de226eb2071faef
msgid "`energy_per_atom < -3.5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:469 d879ad2098544e839b7cd68c6935ea9d
msgid "`has_energy && energy > -500`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:471 1b1c0d0b60eb442e9738dce0dcadd877
msgid "按力、应力、virial 筛选"
msgstr "Filter by force, stress, or virial"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:474 9909baec74f94cf2b1d9caa2ded58ab1
msgid "`force.norm > 15`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:475 4237243cd2f74a24ae7d4d35bff0adc4
msgid "`force.err.norm > 0.2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:476 29ddceb73ad346e499be628fa0733f74
msgid "`stress.xx > 5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:477 4ec04aafe29e45e5928b42f808981cd1
msgid "`virial.err.norm > 1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:479 744682c3e1db4cd4a441d677a8185384
msgid "按 atomic property 筛选"
msgstr "Filter by an atomic property"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:481 597276ee3b764226a5f00613e73a911a
msgid "`atomic.spin_vec.norm > 1.5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:482 6423fd1857a34c228d96ed94b0890bbd
msgid "`atomic.spin_scalar > 0.1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:484 c5dfceae340e42d898dbaacda1dedbf8
msgid "组合条件"
msgstr "Combine conditions"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:486 a9ee89162b6443f6ad07ed7f47c7a8b6
msgid "`has.H && natoms < 50 && energy_per_atom < -2.5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:487 78327070b33847ce99ec9aca2764aa22
msgid "`(count.Fe >= 2) && (force.norm > 8 || stress.norm > 2)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:489 9a1c512d59854ec09a8972d812025148
msgid "6.3.9 补全与右侧数量说明"
msgstr "6.3.9 Autocomplete and availability counts"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:491 3f4d59704edc4963b7460db14589001a
msgid "expression 模式使用单独的动态补全，不和 `tag/formula/elements` 共用缓存。"
msgstr ""
"Expression mode uses its own dynamic autocomplete and does not share the "
"cache used by `tag`, `formula`, or `elements`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:493 bfa0939e425e490da2c628d18b779d67
msgid "补全来源包括："
msgstr "Autocomplete sources include:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:495 19de84207a4c4a1e867db212d80e3b46
msgid "内置结构字段，例如 `natoms`、`volume`"
msgstr "Built-in structure fields such as `natoms` and `volume`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:496 bf5f702b3e2f4957a00e06c9eaf3dc5d
msgid "元素统计字段，例如 `count.Fe`、`frac.O`"
msgstr "Element-statistics fields such as `count.Fe` and `frac.O`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:497 6cc49dd2088b46b382a3a9866630b553
msgid "当前数据集中真实存在的动态字段，例如 `force.ref.x`、`virial.ref.xx`"
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fields actually present in the dataset, such as `force.ref.x` and "
"`virial.ref.xx`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:498 f4c457a252f04d44b6d2dc42004439c6
msgid "当前结构里真实存在的原子属性字段，例如 `atomic.spin_vec.y`"
msgstr ""
"Atomic properties actually present in current structures, such as "
"`atomic.spin_vec.y`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:500 7a5be8abf63942a09bedc0a09eaee47f
msgid "补全列表右侧的数字不是“本次搜索命中数”，而是“当前 active structures 中有多少个结构对这个候选字段是可用的/有意义的”："
msgstr ""
"The number shown to the right of an autocomplete item is not the current "
"search-match count. It is the number of active structures for which that "
"candidate field is available or meaningful:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:502 157225493dad485ca78a3cea911f19c0
msgid "`natoms` 右侧数字通常等于当前 active structures 总数"
msgstr "For `natoms`, the number normally equals the active-structure count."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:503 77e15a60bc424e4b84f47968f84c484d
msgid "`count.Fe` 右侧数字表示包含 `Fe` 的结构数"
msgstr "For `count.Fe`, it is the number of structures containing Fe."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:504 873819738644446ba834b61bdaf68c29
msgid "`has.H` 右侧数字表示包含 `H` 的结构数"
msgstr "For `has.H`, it is the number of structures containing H."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:505 45354470cd714f9e8157dc3ec28aae25
msgid "`force.ref.x` 右侧数字表示当前有 `force` 数据的结构数"
msgstr "For `force.ref.x`, it is the number of structures with force data."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:506 d2b318bc6ca343bfb172e02fd9d0cd56
msgid "`atomic.spin_vec.y` 右侧数字表示当前有 `spin_vec` 原子属性的结构数"
msgstr ""
"For `atomic.spin_vec.y`, it is the number of structures with a `spin_vec` "
"atomic property."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:508 501a1c4fc76a4e04a4acfe025f69635c
msgid "这和你实际输入完整表达式后的命中数量不是一回事。"
msgstr ""
"This availability count is distinct from the number of matches produced by a"
" complete expression."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:510 07e88271b65e48e5bf95ddc82c84a30d
msgid "6.3.10 错误与排查"
msgstr "6.3.10 Errors and troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:512 2bab9c71dfa84b9f96d431724b76c8ce
msgid "常见错误包括："
msgstr "Common errors include:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:514 425768c99dd34c848c7bff2982b62cde
msgid "`Unknown field in expression`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:515 021e32fa650c4ab5b61b2f4a520f37dd
msgid "字段不存在，或当前数据里没有这个字段"
msgstr "The field does not exist or is absent from the current data."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:516 79d965b45499403381dffeb5372856c5
msgid "`Unknown atomic field`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:517 1855598a530b476e88c7baa299d4e3f6
msgid "`atomic.<name>` 写错了，或当前结构没有该原子属性"
msgstr "`atomic.<name>` is misspelled or the structures lack that atomic property."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:518 29963ffb84144733a7aedba07fdc26de
msgid "`Numeric component suffixes are not supported`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:519 2a37be48f02945b894fe2c46308b0617
msgid "使用了 `.1/.2/.3` 这类数字分量"
msgstr "A numeric component such as `.1`, `.2`, or `.3` was used."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:520 ee8c2ad8e7dd41e5a8c7833bc83cac34
msgid "`Field 'xxx' requires an explicit component or '.norm'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:521 5b81aae8e1634c93b375175a0d78538f
msgid "多分量字段没有写具体分量"
msgstr "A multicomponent field lacks a named component or `.norm`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:522 ae1c7128b34b47f1b45d50427137d203
msgid "`does not support value views`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:523 c644577cdbd14a228d69ffb8049103dc
msgid "给不支持的字段写了 `.pred` 或 `.err`"
msgstr "`.pred` or `.err` was appended to a field that does not support paired views."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:524 37a229bdc0df4c87871f6e67569a8982
msgid "`Invalid expression syntax`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:525 3468f7207ade47ad9f508d2ef2db5693
msgid "语法不完整，例如 `force.x >`"
msgstr "The expression is incomplete, for example `force.x >`."

