msgstr "7 — Status indicators and common messages"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:531 0b0e42b04e16450ebb628d5b61f0e0c5
msgid "数据状态：`Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej`。"
msgstr "Dataset status: `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:532 cdb9591c42384da794a06965dbff59ed
msgid "结构状态：最短键长异常会红字提示；净力显示 `|ΣF|`。"
