#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:124
#: 744222a5210b4db5a482304bb005e86e
msgid "`Global FPS (compatible)`：保留原有全局 FPS 行为；"
msgstr "`Global FPS (compatible)`: preserves the original global FPS behavior;"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:125
#: 80e57f85e6f0452a90ffd2c8a569c528
msgid "`Element-set balanced FPS`：按元素集合分组，每组至少保留一个名额，其余名额按组大小平方根分配，并从各组描述符中心开始采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Element-set balanced FPS`: groups structures by element set, reserves at"
" least one slot per group, distributes the remaining slots in proportion "
"to the square root of group size, and starts sampling from each group's "
"descriptor center."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:134
#: 8daf93575fc649eab7c7ddf757f242e6
msgid ""
"平衡模式固定使用结构级原始描述符和固定数量采样，因此会锁定 `Sampling mode` 与 `Descriptor "
"source`；全局模式仍可自由选择原有选项。"
msgstr ""
"Balanced mode always uses raw structure-level descriptors and a fixed "
"sample count, so `Sampling mode` and `Descriptor source` are locked. "
"Global mode continues to allow the original options."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:135
#: 75ba4b1757004f18ac749c54cf89ac14
msgid "提供训练集时，全局模式延续原有整体 warm start；平衡模式只使用元素集合相同的已有结构初始化距离。"
msgstr ""
"With a training set, global mode keeps the original whole-dataset warm "
"start, while balanced mode initializes distances only from existing "
"structures with the same element set."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:136
#: 3a3da1bf75fd44aeb032ecd918040036
msgid "执行结果：运行 FPS 后更新选择集；平衡模式完成后会提示实际选择数量和覆盖的元素集合数。"
msgstr ""
"Result: FPS updates the selection set. Balanced mode also reports the "
"actual number selected and the number of element sets covered."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:281
#: bcc7713523a84109b843cfc8815d1f8b
msgid "6. 结构筛选栏"
msgstr "6 — Structure filter bar"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:283
#: 93d94e6b6efa46bf9541f40a5673be20
msgid "结构筛选栏可以同时使用配置类型、化学式、元素和自定义表达式。条件默认取交集；经常重复使用的组合可以保存为“常用筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"The structure filter bar combines configuration type, formula, element, "
"and custom-expression conditions. Conditions use intersection logic by "
"default, and combinations you use repeatedly can be saved under `Saved "
"filters`."

