#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:287
#: cbf9386933d74766bf5bd0b283392cfb
msgid "6.1 基本流程"
msgstr "6.1 Basic workflow"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:289
#: 4b942c1b0e4a48b1877c55eb94784584
msgid "点击“筛选条件”打开编辑器。空筛选会自动出现第一行。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Filter conditions` to open the editor. An empty filter starts with"
" one blank row."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:290
#: a278b864277840c1b8eaa6781af5dcc0
msgid "在左下角点击“+”继续添加条件，例如“配置类型包含 `surface`”“必须包含 `Fe,O`”“不得包含 `H`”。"
msgstr ""
"Click `+` in the lower-left corner to add more conditions, such as "
"`Config type contains surface`, `Must contain Fe,O`, and `Must not "
"contain H`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:291
#: f4ec7603fea946e68756a53bac78d167
msgid "在右上角选择“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”。"
msgstr ""
"Choose `Match all conditions (AND)` or `Match any condition (OR)` in the "
"upper-right corner."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:292
#: 2c0d64efaa4948ab868e7315b816ce50
msgid "点击“完成并预览”。图中的匹配高亮只用于预览，不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Done and preview`. The highlighted matches in the plot are only a "
"preview and do not change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:293
#: 65ea37573a9145ce8387681bf07b551a
msgid "确认匹配数量后，在“应用结果”中选择“替换当前选择”“加入当前选择”或“从当前选择中移除”。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the match count, choose `Replace current selection`, `Add "
"to current selection`, or `Remove from current selection` from `Apply "
"result`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:295
#: 029ab9dd39f74a1c991e008a92431691
msgid "修改条件后，旧匹配结果会显示为“结果已过期”。重新预览前不能继续应用旧结果。"
msgstr ""
"After a condition changes, the previous match result is marked `Result is"
" stale` and cannot be applied until you preview again."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:297
#: 1a09df6b424349329a224fc29754bc18
msgid "编辑器右下角的垃圾篓按钮只清空筛选条件和匹配高亮，**不会清空当前选择**。清空选择位于“应用结果”菜单中。"
msgstr ""
"The trash button in the lower-right corner of the editor clears only the "
"filter conditions and match highlight; it **does not clear the current "
"selection**. Use `Clear current selection` in the `Apply result` menu for"
" that action."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:299
#: bf7855d08e1e42f5807c2390ac3beb9d
