msgstr "None of the listed elements may be present"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: 873819738644446ba834b61bdaf68c29
msgid "`H` 排除含 H 结构"
msgstr "`H` excludes structures containing H"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: 118f72d0c42f4e4ba38043e304c1144e
msgid "只允许这些元素"
msgstr "Allow only these elements"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: 7a18d21feab14cca9a7714e6deea058d
msgid "结构中不能出现列表外元素"
msgstr "The structure cannot contain elements outside the list"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: ec78e052f53946e085b754c3890921ba
msgid "`Fe,O` 可匹配 Fe、O 和 FeO"
msgstr "`Fe,O` matches Fe, O, and FeO"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: 2b9c62278c7e44878ab3441670cfbdd7
msgid "自定义表达式"
msgstr "Custom expression"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:60
#: 65718fb3d36f4471a06d64497687ecf0
msgid "使用现有结构表达式引擎"
msgstr "Uses the existing structure-expression engine"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:310
#: 5676754a58da42858fff7d8030bcd808
msgid "同一条配置类型或化学式条件可以用分号输入多个值，多个值之间取“任一匹配”。元素之间使用逗号或空格分隔，例如 `Fe, O`。"
msgstr ""
"Enter multiple values in one configuration-type or formula condition by "
"separating them with semicolons; matching any value is sufficient. "
"Separate elements with commas or spaces, for example `Fe, O`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:312
#: 1568604ce02845aa9ae4010bc168d89a
msgid "每行左侧的开关控制该条件是否参与筛选。关闭条件不会删除输入内容。配置类型和化学式右侧的 `Aa` 控制是否区分大小写；高亮时区分，未高亮时不区分。"
msgstr ""
"The switch on the left of each row controls whether that condition takes "
"part in filtering. Turning it off keeps the entered value. For config "
"type and formula conditions, `Aa` controls case sensitivity: highlighted "
"means case-sensitive; otherwise matching is case-insensitive."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:314
#: ccb6d3612dc3476eab8cadaa40c27dbc
msgid "非法正则、未知元素或错误表达式会直接标记对应条件，不会被当成“0 个匹配”，也不会意外匹配全部结构。"
msgstr ""
"An invalid regular expression, unknown element, or invalid expression "
"marks the corresponding condition directly. It is not treated as zero "
"matches and cannot accidentally match every structure."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:316
#: f7f67dbd2f8e4eb7b79ecd1d239393c8
