msgstr "Configuration type contains `surface`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:321
#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:588
#: 3b4a660a6172419da984a79a7b33abce
msgid "必须包含元素 `Fe,O`"
msgstr "Must contain elements `Fe,O`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:322
#: 3b4a660a6172419da984a79a7b33abce
msgid "不得包含元素 `H`"
msgstr "Must not contain element `H`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:323
#: deb73797b5c34e13a2bb4c543e19323e
msgid "条件关系为“满足全部条件（AND）”"
msgstr "Logic set to `Match all conditions (AND)`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:325
#: 8af802ea298d4d209c77feb65e082c8c
msgid "保存一次后，下次不需要逐行重填："
msgstr "After saving it once, you do not need to re-enter every row next time:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:327
#: e302deb021a9473d95302dda252050be
msgid "先把条件、AND/OR 关系和 `Aa` 状态设置好。"
msgstr "Set the conditions, AND/OR logic, and `Aa` states."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:328
#: ee8b9054704049039dac77da849a3eb5
msgid "点击“常用筛选 → 保存当前条件…”。"
msgstr "Choose `Saved filters → Save current conditions…`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:329
#: c9638eb152cc495c97eb050492263008
msgid "输入容易识别的名称，例如 `Fe-O surface`，然后点击“保存”。"
msgstr "Enter a recognizable name such as `Fe-O surface`, then click `Save`."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:330
#: 321d5def47c9417fbeaec8b8a20634bc
msgid "下次打开编辑器时，点击“常用筛选”，再直接点击该名称。"
msgstr ""
"The next time you open the editor, click `Saved filters`, then click that"
" name."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:332
#: 8e396800295d404e9df85fd12b2866f7
