#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:334
#: cc75d05e51524fd3a0c3969fe5053c89
msgid "加载常用筛选会**替换编辑器里的当前条件**，随后更新预览；它不会自动执行“应用结果”，也不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr ""
"Loading a saved filter **replaces the conditions currently in the "
"editor** and then refreshes the preview. It does not run `Apply result` "
"automatically and does not change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:336
#: bfa0939e425e490da2c628d18b779d67
msgid "保存内容包括："
msgstr "A saved filter includes:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:338
#: 5ed0c9cad72640acabbf023d82ebdea2
msgid "每条条件的类型、输入值和启用状态"
msgstr "Each condition's type, entered values, and enabled state"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:339
#: 095c22f5b7d34a47a2aa901e0d5003a2
msgid "配置类型或化学式的匹配方式与 `Aa` 状态"
msgstr "The match mode and `Aa` state for config type or formula conditions"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:340
#: bafb21946a7d4d5eb0d76c2c90bef8e4
msgid "“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”"
msgstr "`Match all conditions (AND)` or `Match any condition (OR)`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:342
#: 80a1ec04a5d248c096c8ba060671f25f
msgid ""
"常用筛选保存在本机用户配置中，关闭并重新打开软件后仍可使用。它不会保存当前匹配结果、当前选择、数据集路径或 NEP "
"模型；保存的是筛选条件，不是自动处理流程。"
msgstr ""
"Saved filters are stored in the local user configuration and remain "
"available after restarting the application. They do not store the current "
"match result, current selection, dataset path, or NEP model; this feature "
"stores filter conditions, not an automated processing workflow."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:344
