msgid "需要维护已有条目时，进入“常用筛选 → 管理常用筛选”："
msgstr "To maintain existing entries, open `Saved filters → Manage saved filters`:"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:346
#: 8b5e285cd9a944369abe809ffbd13094
msgid "“重命名”只修改名称，不改变条件。"
msgstr "`Rename` changes only the name, not the conditions."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:347
#: 03415c4d92744c5ab54e2df1c13cbfff
msgid "“删除”只删除保存的条目，不清空编辑器中的当前条件。"
msgstr ""
"`Delete` removes only the saved entry; it does not clear the current "
"editor conditions."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:348
#: 7e81316b6ef04a9a96f763f71802f9cc
msgid "保存或重命名为已有名称时，软件会先询问是否覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"When saving or renaming to an existing name, the application asks before "
"overwriting it."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:350
#: a71aaf6aac124a6d98d373b5a5929106
msgid "如果条件中仍有空白行，软件不会保存。请补全该行，或用行尾的“×”先删除它。"
msgstr ""
"A filter with a blank row cannot be saved. Complete that row or remove it"
" with the `×` at the end."

