#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:583
#: 0752c5f2c6c94942a30422749bfe4a4a
msgid "添加“自定义表达式”条件后，直接输入完整表达式。表达式仍由原有求值器执行，因此本节列出的字段、运算符和动态数据能力都可以继续使用。"
msgstr ""
"After adding a `Custom expression` condition, enter the complete "
"expression directly. The existing evaluator still executes it, so all "
"fields, operators, and dynamic-data capabilities described in this "
"section remain available."

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:585
#: 1d22d17981cf4e72b3b72c1aa9b856cb
msgid "表达式可以和其他条件组合。例如："
msgstr "An expression can be combined with other conditions. For example:"

