#: a9ee89162b6443f6ad07ed7f47c7a8b6
msgid "自定义表达式 `natoms >= 64 && force.error.norm < 0.2`"
msgstr "Custom expression `natoms >= 64 && force.error.norm < 0.2`"

#: ../../source/module/show-nep-reference.md:591
#: 22b81088529a4d62ab636277649d6aa5
msgid "三条条件在“满足全部条件”下会取交集。筛选器不会把表达式转换成另一套简化语法，因此不会丢失 `!=`、晶格角、布尔字段或动态字段。"
msgstr ""
"With `Match all conditions`, the three conditions are intersected. The "
"filter does not convert expressions into a second simplified syntax, so "
"operators such as `!=`, lattice angles, Boolean fields, and dynamic "
"fields are preserved."
